{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "crime_masks",
  "spec": ["crime 7", "crime 17.10"],
  "description": "Test 10 and the type list of 7. Mask parsing: each byte b sets bit (b - 1) mod 32; a byte 0 makes the mask 0xFFFFFFFF; a present but empty array gives 0 (never matches, [quirk]); a missing property gives 0xFFFFFFFF. By hand: [0] -> all; [] -> 0; [1, 3] -> 0x5; [9] -> 0x100; [33] -> shift 32 mod 32 = 0 -> 0x1; missing -> all. The shipped list (14 exemplars in ascending instance order) yields the 7 table: purpose [9,1,2,3,4,6,7,8] -> 0x1EF, [4,2,3] -> 0xE, [4,2] -> 0xA, [3,2] -> 0x6, [1] -> 0x1; wealth [2,1] -> 0x3, [3,2] -> 0x6; zone [1] -> 0x1; condition [3] -> 0x4. Defaults of a bare exemplar: severity 64, arson off, weight 10, masks all. The display name is the LTEXT string named by the three u32 of 0x8A416B2E when the host has it, else the inline 'Crime Name' string 0xAA12FCB0 (read only when the LTEXT load fails), else empty (7, spec answer C2). Shipped keys (7, spec answer C3): icons (0x7AB50E44, 0x1ABE787D, instance) with the instances of the 7 table (Bank Robbery shares Mugging's 0xAA63966B); name keys (0x2026960B, 0x0A554AE0, instance), no inline names. The host here has only the key 0xEA5EA698 (as the English locale, whose text is an unrelated building description), so Generic gets that text and every other shipped type an empty name.",
  "steps": [
    {"op": "crime_eval", "fn": "mask", "args": [[0]], "expect": "0xFFFFFFFF"},
    {"op": "crime_eval", "fn": "mask", "args": [[]], "expect": 0},
    {"op": "crime_eval", "fn": "mask", "args": [[1, 3]], "expect": 5},
    {"op": "crime_eval", "fn": "mask", "args": [[9]], "expect": "0x100"},
    {"op": "crime_eval", "fn": "mask", "args": [[33]], "expect": 1},
    {"op": "crime_eval", "fn": "mask", "args": [[32]], "expect": "0x80000000"},
    {"op": "crime_eval", "fn": "mask", "args": [null], "expect": "0xFFFFFFFF"},
    {"op": "crime_eval", "fn": "lot_bits", "args": [5, [2, 3], 3], "expect": {"zone": 2, "wealth": 4, "purpose": 2, "condition": 2}},
    {"op": "crime_eval", "fn": "lot_bits", "args": [9, null, 6], "expect": {"zone": 4, "wealth": "0x80000000", "purpose": "0x100", "condition": 2}},
    {"op": "crime_eval", "fn": "lot_bits", "args": [0, [0, 0], 0], "expect": {"zone": "0x80000000", "wealth": "0x80000000", "purpose": "0x100", "condition": 1}},

    {"op": "crime_env", "ltext": [{"key": ["0x2026960B", "0x0A554AE0", "0xEA5EA698"], "text": "unrelated building text"}]},
    {"op": "crime_create"},
    {"op": "crime_init"},
    {"op": "crime_expect", "state": {"types": [
      {"id": 1, "name": "unrelated building text", "severity": 40, "weight": 0, "arson": false, "zone": "0xFFFFFFFF", "wealth": "0xFFFFFFFF", "purpose": "0xFFFFFFFF", "condition": "0xFFFFFFFF", "icon": ["0x7AB50E44", "0x1ABE787D", "0x8A1DC833"]},
